  "title": {
    "rendered": "Container Offices for Sale in South Delhi"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>Looking for a container office in South Delhi? SAMAN Portable manufactures and supplies steel-framed container offices across South Delhi — Saket, Hauz Khas, Nehru Place, Okhla and Greater Kailash — and the wider Delhi NCR. Each unit is built at our factory and delivered ready to use, so you get a working office, sales space or project site office without the cost and delay of permanent construction in a high-value part of the city.</p>\n\n<h2>Container Offices for Sale in South Delhi</h2>\n<p>A container office is a factory-built steel cabin that serves as an office, sales counter or project site office without any foundation. For South Delhi businesses and project sites, it arrives finished, works from day one, and can be relocated when the requirement moves. SAMAN supplies 10ft, 20ft and 40ft units on an MS steel frame, customised to your layout.</p>\n\n<h2>Container office sizes we supply</h2>\n<p>Three standard footprints, each customised internally for the use.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>Size</th><th>Typical use</th><th>Fit-out</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>10ft</td><td>Single-desk office, sales booth, reception or guard cabin</td><td>Door, window, lighting, power points</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20ft</td><td>Team office for 4–6, project site office, display unit</td><td>AC provision, partitions, storage, workstations</td></tr>\n<tr><td>40ft</td><td>Larger office, meeting room + workspace, multi-room layout</td><td>Multiple rooms, washroom provision, networking</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All units are built on an MS steel frame to IS 2062, with insulated wall and roof panels for year-round comfort. Stackable and relocatable layouts are available where access allows.</p>\n\n<h2>Why buy your container office direct from SAMAN</h2>\n<p>SAMAN POS India Private Limited is a manufacturer, not a marketplace or reseller. Buying direct keeps price, build quality and after-sales support with one company.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Factory-built quality:</strong> MS steel frame to IS 2062; ISO 9001:2015 certified.</li>\n<li><strong>Backed warranty:</strong> 5 years structural frame and base + 1–2 years finishing + 20–25 years engineered service life.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear logistics:</strong> delivery from ₹3,000, typical transit 3–5 days, returns within 7 days of delivery/installation.</li>\n<li><strong>Made to your use:</strong> office, sales or project-site layouts customised before dispatch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Delivery and installation in South Delhi</h2>\n<p>We deliver finished container offices across South Delhi and the wider NCR from our North India manufacturing unit. Each cabin arrives structurally complete, so installation on a prepared, level surface is quick and there is no extended on-site construction. Because the unit is movable, it can be repositioned or relocated as your project or office requirement changes.</p>\n\n<h2>Get a container office quote in South Delhi</h2>\n<p>Share the size, layout and the South Delhi location, and we will send current pricing and a delivery estimate. Price depends on size, fit-out and distance, so we quote against your real requirement. <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product-category/container-offices\">View our container office range</a> to begin.</p>\n<p><strong>Call +91 88616 22859</strong> or use <strong>Send Enquiry</strong> for a quote to your South Delhi location.</p>\n\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<br>\n<h3>What container office sizes are available in South Delhi?</h3>\n<p>We supply 10ft, 20ft and 40ft container offices and customise the layout — from a single-desk office or sales booth to a larger multi-room office.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How long does delivery to South Delhi take?</h3>\n<p>Units are factory-built and typically reach South Delhi and NCR sites within a 3–5 day transit window once the order and layout are confirmed. Delivery starts from ₹3,000.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Can the container office be customised?</h3>\n<p>Yes. We fit doors, windows, electricals, partitions, washroom provision and storage to your plan at the factory, so the unit arrives ready to use.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>What warranty do I get?</h3>\n<p>5 years on the structural frame and base, 1–2 years on finishing, and a 20–25 year engineered service life (the engineered life of the structure, not a warranty period).</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Are these new or used container offices?</h3>\n<p>New only — manufactured on an MS steel frame to IS 2062. We do not supply second-hand or refurbished units.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How do I get a price for South Delhi?</h3>\n<p>Call +91 88616 22859 or use Send Enquiry with your size, layout and location, and we will quote against your requirement.</p>",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>Discover elegant Container Offices in South Delhi designed for premium projects. Custom modular workspaces with luxury finishes for architects, developers &amp; contractors. Schedule a consultation today.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
